SELECT id, 'A', 'process_step_confusion', $a15A$Treats a structure merely adjacent to the somite (the neural tube and its motor neurons) as sharing the somite's mesodermal origin, conflating spatial adjacency with developmental lineage$a15A$ FROM q
UNION ALL SELECT id, 'B', 'partial_truth', $a15B$Names a genuinely mesoderm-derived axial structure (notochord) as the answer, exploiting a true fact about germ-layer origin while ignoring that the scenario specifies the somite-derived contractile tissue$a15B$ FROM q
